{"id": "whistleblower-vendor-contract-enforcement", "title": "A department ended a vendor relationship after repeated short-term agreements", "seconds": 48.6, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "6dd30428108b0b5f", "words": 121, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A City department repeatedly approved short-term deals in place of a long-term agreement.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.18, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["When", "contract", "terms", "went", "unenforced"], "sub": "City whistleblower reports"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.47, 1.03, 1.63, 2.08, 2.72, 3.14, 3.29, 3.59, 3.69, 3.77, 4.34]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Investigators substantiated that its manager failed to enforce contract terms.", "t0": 5.3, "t1": 9.99, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "q125", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, Whistleblower Program", "text": "September 2024 report", "mark": "September 2024 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.83, 1.67, 1.83, 2.04, 2.58, 2.93, 3.05, 3.56, 4.15]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The department ended the vendor relationship during the investigation.", "t0": 10.11, "t1": 13.61, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Vendor relationship ended"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.68, 1.0, 1.11, 1.44, 2.11, 2.39, 2.51]}, {"scene": "older", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In a separate case, a contractor stopped providing required services.", "t0": 13.83, "t1": 17.84, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "q223", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, Whistleblower Program", "text": "December 2022 report", "mark": "December 2022 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.25, 0.59, 0.97, 1.09, 1.75, 2.13, 2.66, 3.2]}, {"scene": "older", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The contractor moved equipment between service areas without telling the department.", "t0": 17.96, "t1": 22.41, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Equipment moved"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.84, 1.12, 1.58, 2.01, 2.47, 2.89, 3.26, 3.61, 3.73]}, {"scene": "older", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The department adopted a plan to monitor spending, equipment and service delivery.", "t0": 22.53, "t1": 27.39, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "q223", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, Whistleblower Program", "text": "Monitoring plan", "mark": "Monitoring plan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.67, 1.13, 1.21, 1.59, 1.73, 2.22, 2.89, 3.53, 3.77, 4.22]}, {"scene": "older", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A third investigation found that a contractor wrongly charged a member of the public.", "t0": 27.51, "t1": 32.11, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "q124", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, Whistleblower Program", "text": "September 2023 report", "mark": "September 2023 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.5, 1.4, 1.66, 1.78, 1.86, 2.57, 3.05, 3.53, 3.61, 3.93, 4.02, 4.11]}, {"scene": "older", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The contractor reimbursed the customer and retrained its employee.", "t0": 32.23, "t1": 36.06, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Customer reimbursement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.88, 1.52, 1.63, 2.16, 2.3, 2.9, 3.1]}, {"scene": "status", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]", "established[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "The three reports describe different actions in different periods.", "t0": 36.28, "t1": 40.04, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Three quarterly reports", "heading": "Actions reported", "source": "q125", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "December 2022", "value": "Monitoring plan"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "September 2023", "value": "Customer reimbursement"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "September 2024", "value": "Vendor relationship ended"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 0.98, 1.51, 1.91, 2.53, 2.68, 3.05]}, {"scene": "status", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The reports do not establish that the same vendor was involved, or quantify a loss.", "t0": 40.16, "t1": 44.99, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Identities in the reports", "Amount of loss"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.59, 0.75, 0.95, 1.54, 1.7, 1.82, 2.14, 2.55, 2.76, 3.36, 3.57, 4.23, 4.31]}, {"scene": "status", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 45.11, "t1": 47.72, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Separate investigations", "older": "Two earlier cases", "status": "What the reports identify"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "timeline"}